{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Mrs Kruger, come through please. Observations are done. Today the blood pressure is 136 over 78, pulse 72, oxygen 98 percent. Last time it was around 150.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Thank you, sister. I do apologise for being late. The parking was quite impossible.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (DOCTOR): Sit. Reason for coming?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): The six week check after my hip replacement, doctor.",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (DOCTOR): Which side?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): The left hip, if you please.",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (DOCTOR): Pain?",
  "[SEG0008] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Tell him about the nights, Mum, you—",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): It is still rather sore, doctor. Mild, mostly in the evenings.",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (DOCTOR): Since when?",
  "[SEG0011] person_2 (PATIENT): Six weeks, since the operation itself.",
  "[SEG0012] person_3 (DOCTOR): Calf swelling?",
  "[SEG0013] person_2 (PATIENT): No. There is no swelling of the calf.",
  "[SEG0014] person_3 (DOCTOR): Looking now. Wound is healed. No redness, no discharge.",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (DOCTOR): Using a stick?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes. I walk with a stick, indoors and when we go out.",
  "[SEG0017] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Every morning in the passage, and the neighbour's dog—",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (DOCTOR): Mm. Your tablets?",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (PATIENT): Aspirin, 150 milligrams once a day, by mouth, for the clots.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): And paracetamol, two tablets when the hip is sore. Not every day.",
  "[SEG0021] person_3 (DOCTOR): Stomach medicine?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): Err, Omprazole, 20 milligrams every morning.",
  "[SEG0023] person_3 (DOCTOR): For the pressure?",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes. The blood pressure has been a problem for years. Mizartan, eighty milligrams daily.",
  "[SEG0025] person_3 (DOCTOR): The sugar?",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): Metformine, 500 milligrams twice a day. Umm.",
  "[SEG0027] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): And that old test, Mum—",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): Of. I am diabetic, yes. They said it was borderline, the old sugar test, years ago, before these tablets.",
  "[SEG0029] person_3 (DOCTOR): Bowels alright?",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes, quite normal, thank you.",
  "[SEG0031] person_3 (DOCTOR): Come back in three months. Carry on with the stick. If the calf swells, come the same day.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (PATIENT): Thank you, doctor. We shall come."
 ],
